   Margolina, Tetyana; Joseph, John E., Naval Postgraduate Sch, Dept Oceanog, Monterey, CA USA.
   Thomas, Len, Univ St Andrews, Ctr Res Ecol \& Environm Modelling Observ, St Andrews KY16 9LZ, Fife, Scotland.},
