   Christensen, Villy/0000-0003-0688-2633},
Funding-Acknowledgement = {Global Warming and Arctic Marine Mammal (GWAMM) project under the
   International Polar Year (IPY)},
Funding-Text = {Funding for this project was provided by the Global Warming and Arctic
   Marine Mammal (GWAMM) project under the International Polar Year (IPY)
   funding. Thanks to Steve Ferguson, the principal investigator for the
   GWAMM project, and other project collaborators. A special thanks to
   members of this project for their collaboration and input of data
   regarding Hudson Bay; Jeff Higdon, Elly Chmelnitsky, Magaly Chambellant,
   and Sebastian Luque. To the numerous researchers who assisted me with
   expert knowledge when information was needed; Jim Reist, Ross Tallman,
   Pierre Richard, Lisa Loseto, Tara Bortoluzzi, David Barber and the
   researchers at CEOS in Winnipeg, and especially Bruce Stewart. Thanks to
   Brooke Campbell, Jeroen Steenbeek, Divya Varkey, Chiara Piroddi, Laura
   Tremblay-Boyer, and Colette Wabnitz for technical assistance. A special
   thank you to Megan Bailey for food web images. Finally, travel to Hudson
