   Reisinger, Ryan R., Univ La Rochelle, Ctr Etud Biol Chize, CNRS, UMR 7372, Villiers En Bois, France.
   Reisinger, Ryan R., CESAB FRB, Aix En Provence, France.
   Raymond, Ben; Sumner, Michael D.; Wotherspoon, Simon, Australian Antarctic Div, Kingston, Tas, Australia.
