   Lindsley were developing protocols for exploring gonadal mosaicism. The
   experiment by James Epler described herein was carried out while he was
   a postdoctoral fellow in the laboratory of Dan Lindsley in the Biology
   Division of the Oak Ridge National Laboratory. The experiments described
   in this communication were carried out by retirees, Dan and Bob, during
   the summer of 2010 in the Department of Cell and Developmental Biology
   at UCSD; at that time Pedro Ripoll joined the effort from Madrid. We
   thank Elena Lorenzo Jimenez for transcribing the raw count data. A
