   Miller, T. J., Univ Maryland, Chesapeake Biol Lab, Ctr Environm Sci, Solomons, MD 20688 USA.
   Latour, R. J., Coll William \& Mary, Virginia Inst Marine Sci, Gloucester Point, VA 23062 USA.
