   Sigourney, Douglas B.; Chavez-Rosales, Samuel; Josephson, Elizabeth, Integrated Stat, Woods Hole, MA 02543 USA.
   Conn, Paul B., NOAA, Natl Marine Mammal Lab, Natl Marine Fisheries Serv, Alaska Fisheries Sci Ctr, Seattle, WA USA.
